37 0 obj
<<
/Title (In a race against time, Ed and Lorraine rushed back into the house to perform an emergency exorcism. With the spirit fighting back with immense supernatural strength, Lorraine managed to reach deep into Carolyn's memories, reminding her of a peaceful family moment to break Bathsheba's hold over her soul. Through sheer willpower and unwavering faith, the Warrens successfully cast out the demonic entity, saving Carolyn's life and lifting the dark curse that had choked the farmhouse for generations.)
/Dest [31 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 312 0 R
